---
/**
 * Note.astro — the boxed aside of the article (`<aside class="note">`).
 *
 * Why: a bare `<aside>` inside `<main>` is a complementary landmark that Axe
 * flags ("landmark-complementary-is-top-level"); `role="note"` keeps the aside
 * semantics without the landmark. Mapped over `aside` in the MDX components.
 *
 * @see https://dequeuniversity.com/rules/axe/4.11/landmark-complementary-is-top-level
 * @see packages/specs/specs/10-tactical-arena-article.md § P10-1 (Grid)
 */
---

<aside class="note" role="note">
	<slot />
</aside>
